  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;are square matrices of order <math><mn>3</mn></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></math> and <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2.25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></math><br />Multiplying by <math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.25</mn></math>",
